Date: Sat, 22 Aug 2026 20:00:14 +0800
Subject: [PATCH 06/16] clk: zte: model ZX279133 firmware-selected top clocks

Consolidate 3 validated ZX279133 development commits into one functional stage.

Original range: 9993aa49f42e32582e2c5899cc8b99b02f22ba8c..d40d1efb732778c0e091472035bf1e52929988e4

Signed-off-by: cnjn <1779895255@qq.com>
